2dddebf5c294a84965de47ef1c78036892637af84ed9e2bb6afd331dba72d358597ad2e5fd93f2b5e8753af59930ca379db58a16ed2940df9dbb871296f12d88  0001-pulse-switch-voice-profiles-for-split-speaker-outputs.patch
"
